        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5c8197b499ac44efbbbc43afa6ad842e",
      "statement": "Run mode is recomputed on every attempt because requeueing records nothing about it: `decide_mode` returns `update` when `openwiki/index.md` exists and `init` otherwise, an explicit `update` degrades to `init` without a wiki, the resolved value is written back with `store.update(wiki_id, mode=mode)` so `GET /wikis/{id}` reports what ran, and in `update` mode the pipeline calls `ingestion.ensure_full_history` because a `--depth 1` clone lacks the commit recorded in `openwiki/.last-update.json`.",
