    {
      "id": "claim_d58b92b3614e48f5aef78fd560ef4f08",
      "statement": "A retried wiki whose earlier attempt already packaged a zip keeps serving it: `GET /wikis/{id}/download` only checks that `wiki.zip` exists (not the status), and `pack_wiki` writes `wiki.zip.tmp` before atomically replacing the destination, so the previous archive stays downloadable during the new attempt.",
